urn every gram into profit. Featuring fully manual mechanics, a grim atmosphere, and relentless orders. Leave your morals at the door. Just chop.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Turkish, Portuguese - Portugal, Korean, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233030/0fe1fac9d18fe29e2e1cb6cd35fc1c45a30e7d93/header.jpg?t=1778586080", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233030/3a8e3e534a27d801a8b7e983d2a693e1e805fbd2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778586080", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233030/3a8e3e534a27d801a8b7e983d2a693e1e805fbd2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778586080", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVidia GeForce GTX 750<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Untitle Game Studio"], "pu